# Cloud Security for SOC Analysts

## AWS Key Log Source: CloudTrail
- Logs every API call in AWS account
- Key suspicious calls: CreateUser, AttachUserPolicy, DeleteTrail, ListBuckets

## Azure Key Log Sources
- Azure Activity Log — resource management changes
- Azure AD Sign-in Logs — authentication
- Microsoft Defender for Cloud — security alerts

## Critical Detections

### CloudTrail — Disable Logging (T1562.008) — P1 ALERT
```spl
index=cloudtrail eventName IN ("DeleteTrail","StopLogging","UpdateTrail")
| table _time, userIdentity.userName, eventName, sourceIPAddress
```

### CloudTrail — IAM Privilege Escalation
```spl
index=cloudtrail eventName IN ("CreateUser","AttachUserPolicy","CreateAccessKey","AddUserToGroup")
| table _time, userIdentity.userName, eventName, sourceIPAddress
```

### S3 Data Exfiltration
```spl
index=cloudtrail eventName="GetObject"
| stats count by sourceIPAddress, requestParameters.bucketName
| where count > 100
```

